      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upplands_V%C3%A4sby",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Väsby Gard estate showcases traditional Swedish architecture and reflects the region’s historic building style.",
